 "stimulus_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"2\">\n  <li>The function <span data-math=\"h\">h</span> given by <span data-math=\"h(t)=(1−t)(8+16t)\">h(t)=(1−t)(8+16t)</span> models the height of a ball in feet, <span data-math=\"t\">t</span> seconds after it was thrown.</li>\n</ol>",
